<title>USA: Rain may bring more floods to Germany, Poland -WSC.</title>
<headline>Rain may bring more floods to Germany, Poland -WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moderate to heavy rain may develop later on Friday and into Saturday in northeastern Europe, including Poland, the Czech Republic, and eastern Germany, following the recent severe flooding, independent forecaster Weather Services Corp said.</p>
<p>Additional flooding was likely to occur with the next round of rain, it said.</p>
